    "title": "Who Will Be On 'Celebrity Jeopardy!' This Season?",
    "text": "Published March 13, 2026, 3:00 p.m. ET Jury Duty Presents: Company Retreat - Trailer0 seconds of 2 minutes, 36 secondsVolume 0% Can I have “great ways to spend an evening home alone” for $1000? Celebrity Jeopardy! will return with a new All Stars season on ABC on Friday, March 13th. The celebrity edition of Jeopardy! was revived by ABC in 2022 and has since featured an array of recognizable competitors. This is the first all stars season of Celebrity Jeopardy! with 21 players returning to the iconic stage. The Studio’s Ike Barinholtz currently reigns as the biggest Celebrity Jeopardy! champ with winnings totaling $72,001 from his victory in Season 1. Tune in to Season 4 to see if he can defend his title against this cast of all stars. While previous competitors including Micheal Cera and Simu Liu will not be returning for a second chance at Jeopardy! glory, the cast is stacked with familiar favorites. Visit Advertiser websiteGO TO PAGE Who Will Be on Celebrity Jeopardy! in 2026? This season will feature returning competitors from the previous three seasons of the star-studded edition of America’s favorite quiz show. Host Ken Jennings, the late Alex Trebek’s most astute successor, will quiz celebs such as Gilmore Girls’ Sean Gunn and Sex and the City’s Cynthia Nixon try to beat each other to the buzzer, as they compete for charity cash. Zootopia 2’s Macaulay Culkin will also return to Celebrity Jeopardy! to face off against Chicago Med star Steven Weber in the upcoming All Stars season. The winners of the quarterfinals will go on to face one of the past three Celebrity Jeopardy! champions: W. Kamau Bell, Lisa Ann Walter, and Ike Barinholtz. Tune in on Friday nights on ABC or watch the next day on Hulu to see if any of the former runners up can reclaim their glory against the reigning champs. When will Season 4 of Celebrity Jeopardy! All Stars premiere? Season 4 will premiere this Friday, March 13, 7 p.m. ET on ABC, with episodes available to stream the next day on Hulu. Who will be appearing this season and when? March 13 – Rachel Dratch, Mark Duplass, Katie Nolan March 20 – Macauley Culkin, Steven Weber, Jackie Tohn March 27 – Sean Gunn, Cynthia Nixon, Roy Wood Jr. April 10 – Mina Kimes, Andy Richter, Timothy Simons April 17 – Robin Thede, Patton Oswalt, Margaret Cho May 8 – Mira Sorvino, Mo Rocca, Ray Romano May 12 – Lisa Ann Walter May 13 – W. Kamau Bell May 14 – Ike Barinholtz Tags ABC Celebrity Jeopardy ken jennings",
